    "intro_narrative": "You've finally breached the perimeter of the derelict Kurokawa Server Farm, deep in the neon-drenched underbelly of Sector 7. The air is thick with the smell of ozone and damp rust. Your mission is clear: you need to authorize a massive credit transfer from the megacorp's shadow accounts. To do this, you must successfully execute the final banking validation on their network. The server room is a maze of locked terminals, encrypted archives, and scattered data shards left behind by previous rogue runners. You'll need to power up the decryptors, piece together broken script fragments, and trace the data flow through this chaotic web of corporate tech to finalize the transfer and get out before the corporate enforcers arrive.",
    "narrative_style": "cyberpunk"
  },
